  "parsing_notes": [
    "Per-meal macro targets sum exactly to the daily targets (protein 35+40+34=109 g, carbs 95+115+98=308 g, fat 15+17+15=47 g, calories 650+775+675=2100 kcal), so no reconciliation was needed.",
    "Every option within a meal is designed to hit that meal's macro targets, so options are equivalent substitutes rather than distinct macro profiles.",
    "Quantities are as prescribed and refer to raw weight; unquantified items (salads, vegetables, tomato) are represented with quantity: null and free: true.",
    "Eggs are counted in units ('uds'); milk is in ml; everything else is in grams.",
    "'Fruta 150 g' in breakfast option 6 is generic in the source and is flagged with generic: true — any fruit is implied.",
    "Combined-item names were kept intact ('Patata al horno o airfryer', 'Ensalada de tomate, hojas verdes y cebolla') rather than split, since the source treats them as a single line.",
    "Dish names given in the source ('Tortitas', 'Hamburguesa', 'Pizza', 'Bocadillo') are preserved in dish_es/dish_en; other options have none.",
    "Calorie figures are the nutritionist's own; no macro or energy values were recomputed from food databases."
  ]
